The correct approach: use a min-heap where each entry is `(A[i] + A[j], i, j)` with `i <= j`. Start with `(A[0]+A[0], 0, 0)`. When popping `(s, i, j)`, push `(A[i+1]+A[j], i+1, j)` if `i+1 <= j`, and `(A[i]+A[j+1], i, j+1)` if `j+1 < N`. Use a `seen` set to avoid duplicates.

